▀▀▀▀ █▀▀▀ ▀▀▀▀ ▀  ▀ ▀▀▀▀ ▀▀▀▀ ▀▀▀▀ ▀▀▀▀

命令：
  opencode completion          generate shell completion script
  opencode mcp                 manage MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers
  opencode [project]           start opencode tui                                           [默认值]
  opencode attach <url>        attach to a running opencode server
  opencode run [message..]     run opencode with a message
  opencode debug               debugging and troubleshooting tools
  opencode providers           manage AI providers and credentials                   [aliases: auth]
  opencode agent               manage agents
  opencode upgrade [target]    upgrade opencode to the latest or a specific version
  opencode uninstall           uninstall opencode and remove all related files
  opencode serve               starts a headless opencode server
  opencode models [provider]   list all available models
  opencode export [sessionID]  export session data as JSON
  opencode session             manage sessions
  opencode plugin <module>     install plugin and update config                      [aliases: plug]
  opencode db                  database tools

位置：
  project  path to start opencode in                                                        [字符串]

选项：
  -h, --help          show help                                                               [布尔]
  -v, --version       show version number                                                     [布尔]
      --print-logs    print logs to stderr                                                    [布尔]
      --log-level     log level                  [字符串] [可选值: "DEBUG", "INFO", "WARN", "ERROR"]
      --pure          run without external plugins                                            [布尔]
      --port          port to listen on                                           [数字] [默认值: 0]
      --hostname      hostname to listen on                           [字符串] [默认值: "127.0.0.1"]
      --cors          additional domains to allow for CORS                       [数组] [默认值: []]
  -m, --model         model to use in the format of provider/model                          [字符串]
  -c, --continue      continue the last session                                               [布尔]
  -s, --session       session id to continue                                                [字符串]
      --fork          fork the session when continuing (use with --continue or --session)     [布尔]
      --prompt        prompt to use                                                         [字符串]
      --agent         agent to use                                                          [字符串]
      --auto          auto-approve permissions that are not explicitly denied (dangerous!)
                                                                              [布尔] [默认值: false]
      --mini          start the minimal interactive interface                 [布尔] [默认值: false]
      --no-replay     disable mini session history replay on resume and after resize          [布尔]
      --replay-limit  cap visible mini replay to the newest N messages                        [数字]
"
`;

